{
 "title": "Changing Your User Profile",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Changing Your User Profile</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You can make changes to your user profile, like updating your contact information or delivery address.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You can make changes to your user profile, like updating your contact information or delivery address.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loio826ab312824b4f5d854984c4cd2dd002\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Changing Your User Profile</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">You can make changes to your user profile, like updating your contact information or\ndelivery address.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Your user profile stores basic organizational information about you and determines what\nactions you can take. The fields in your profile are configured by your organization.\nChanges to your profile are subject to approval by your supervisor.</p>\n<p class=\"p\">Your organization's policies determine if you can make changes to your profile. </p>\n<p class=\"p\">When you make changes to your profile, you must choose from the options available. For\nexample, if you want to change the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purchasing Unit</span>, open the\ndropdown menu (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) and select <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Search more</span> to find a different\noption, as shown in the following figure.</p>\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio826ab312824b4f5d854984c4cd2dd002__image_fyj_wjm_h2c\" src=\"loioce5dd69513a147a091184b5f272402d1_LowRes.png\" alt=\"On the accounting and shipping tab, there is a dropdown menu for the purchasing unit field and search more is the selected menu option.\" title=\"On the accounting and shipping tab, there is a dropdown menu for the purchasing unit field and search more is the selected menu option.\"></p>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">From the guided buying home page, select the user icon, and then choose <span class=\"ph menucascade\"><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstart.gif\" alt=\"Start of the navigation path\" title=\"Start of the navigation path\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">App settings</span>&nbsp;<img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstep.gif\" alt=\"Next navigation step\" title=\"Next navigation step\">&nbsp;<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Change your profile</span><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navend.gif\" alt=\"End of the navigation path\" title=\"End of the navigation path\"></span>, as shown in the following figure.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio826ab312824b4f5d854984c4cd2dd002__image_vv3_hkm_h2c\" src=\"loiodac08f34577c4f7bbc5664630e7933c3_LowRes.png\" alt=\"The user menu displays a two tiered menu with the app seting and change your profile options selected.\" title=\"The user menu displays a two tiered menu with the app seting and change your profile options selected.\"></div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">On the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Personal Info</span> page, you can make the following\nchanges:</span>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d1894e96-option\">Field name</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d1894e96-desc\">Options</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e109\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Name</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e109\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Enter a name.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e119\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Business Email Address</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e119\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Enter an email address.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e129\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Supervisor</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e129\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Use the options available.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e139\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Groups</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e139\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><ol class=\"ol\" type=\"a\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p>In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Groups</span> section, choose\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Select</span>, which is the last option in the\nlist.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>From the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Choose Values for Groups</span> window, do the following:</p><ul class=\"ul\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Search for a group</span>: Enter the name of a group\nand choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Search</span>.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Add a group</span>: Select the group's checkbox in\nthe <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Add to Currently Selected</span> column.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Remove a group</span>: Deselect the group's checkbox\nin the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Currently Selected</span> column.</p></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Done</span> to save your changes.</p></li>\n</ol></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e203\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Limited Responsibilities</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e203\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>If available, choose the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Add/Remove</span> button to\nrequest changes to your purchasing unit responsibilities. You must be a member\nof the group to make purchasing unit changes.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e216\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Job Profile</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e216\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Use the options available.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-option\" id=\"d1894e226\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Team Requisition Members</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e96-desc d1894e226\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><ol class=\"ol\" type=\"a\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p>From the list of team requisition members, choose\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Select</span>, which is the last option in the\nlist.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>From the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Choose Values for Team Requisition\nMembers</span> window, do the following:</p><ul class=\"ul\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Search for a member</span>: Enter the name and\nchoose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Search</span>.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Add a member</span>: Select the member's checkbox in\nthe <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Add to Currently Selected</span> column.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Remove a member</span>: Deselect the member's\ncheckbox in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Currently Selected</span>\ncolumn.</p></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Done</span> to save your changes.</p></li>\n</ol></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<p class=\"p\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Next</span> or the next step to save your changes.</p>\n\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">On the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Accounting/Shipping</span> page, you can make the following\nchanges:</span>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d1894e300-option\">Field name</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d1894e300-desc\">Options</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-option\" id=\"d1894e313\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">1. Change your organization\ninformation</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-desc d1894e313\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Use the options available to make changes to the following fields:</p><ul class=\"sl simple\">\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Release Authority</span></li>\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Company Code</span></li>\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purch Org</span> (purchasing organization)</li>\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purch Group</span> (purchasing group)</li>\n</ul></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-option\" id=\"d1894e343\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">2. Change your accounting information</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-desc d1894e343\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Use the options available to make changes to the following fields:</p><ul class=\"sl simple\">\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purchasing Unit</span></li>\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">GL Account</span></li>\n<li class=\"sli\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Cost Center</span></li>\n</ul></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-option\" id=\"d1894e367\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">3. Change your shipping and delivery\ninformation</span></p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d1894e300-desc d1894e367\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>To add a plant address (shipping), do the following:</p><ol class=\"ol\" type=\"a\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p>In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Plant</span> section, open the dropdown menu (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) and select <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Search more</span>.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Choose Value for Plant</span> window, choose\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">New</span>.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>Enter details for the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Create Custom Plant</span>\nform.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Save</span> to save your changes.</p></li>\n</ol><p class=\"p\">To add a delivery address, enter the address in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Deliver\nTo</span> field.</p><p class=\"p\">You can also add a new plant address\n(shipping) when you check out. For more information, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"6679821014fc42a1bb50a49b43cd25c1.html\" title=\"You can create personal addresses so goods and services can be sent directly to non-company locations.\">Creating a Personal Address</a>.</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Next</span> or the next step to save your changes.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Justify Changes</span>: Enter a justification for your profile\nchange request. Optionally, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Add Attachment</span> to add an\nattachment. Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Next</span> or the next step.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Approval Flow</span>: Review the approval flow and add approvers,\nif needed. Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Next</span> or the next step.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Review Changes</span>: Review the changes and choose\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Submit</span>.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup stepresult\">To see your changes, you must sign out and then sign back in. Your request\nmust be fully approved before the changes display. If no approvals are required, your\nprofile changes display when you sign back in.</div>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}